00:22:41.264 --> 00:22:42.164
DM: Somehow

00:22:45.644 --> 00:22:46.684
DM: captured and

00:22:47.784 --> 00:22:49.544
DM: grown strong by the

00:22:54.424 --> 00:22:55.764
DM: influence of this

00:22:58.044 --> 00:23:03.384
