00:27:48.740 --> 00:27:49.940
DM: Has not moved at all.

00:27:49.940 --> 00:27:51.960
Seeker: It is a solid jade.

00:27:52.020 --> 00:27:55.880
Kenzo: Kenzo will, uh, approach the statue and he says, um,

00:27:57.920 --> 00:27:58.200
Kenzo: uh,

00:27:59.440 --> 00:28:07.940
Kenzo: "Rai, I know you don't know me, but, uh, I've carried a piece of your hand with me since I was

00:28:09.100 --> 00:28:12.680
Kenzo: a small child. My parents found the piece of you in the deserts,

00:28:13.980 --> 00:28:16.990
Kenzo: and we have, over these past many years-"

00:28:18.180 --> 00:28:20.440
DM: I have seen you in dreams, yes.

00:28:20.440 --> 00:28:21.719
Kenzo: Oh, you have?

00:28:22.680 --> 00:28:24.320
Kenzo: That's good to know.

00:28:24.320 --> 00:28:24.600
Kenzo: Yeah.

00:28:24.600 --> 00:28:26.040
DM: Some of my dreams, I believe.

00:28:26.040 --> 00:28:26.839
Kenzo: What's that?

00:28:26.840 --> 00:28:28.860
DM: Some of my dreams, I believe.

00:28:28.860 --> 00:28:30.080
Kenzo: I've seen...

00:28:30.080 --> 00:28:31.420
Kenzo: You've seen me in your dreams?

00:28:31.420 --> 00:28:32.700
Kenzo: 'Cause I've seen a lot of your dreams.

00:28:35.700 --> 00:28:40.080
DM: I've seen you in those dreams, yes.

00:28:40.080 --> 00:28:42.919
Kenzo: Wow. Just didn't know that worked that way.

00:28:42.920 --> 00:28:43.060
Kenzo: Hmm.

00:28:44.680 --> 00:28:45.800
Kenzo: Well, in any case,

00:28:47.840 --> 00:28:48.420
Kenzo: it has been

00:28:50.320 --> 00:28:52.860
Kenzo: quite a lot of effort as we have, uh,

00:28:54.360 --> 00:28:58.840
Kenzo: collected these fragments [staff rattling] and they have been

00:29:00.660 --> 00:29:03.340
Kenzo: a big part of how we've been able to get here.

00:29:04.380 --> 00:29:08.080
Kenzo: As you can imagine, it's not been, uh, straightforward to find you here in Limbo.

00:29:09.260 --> 00:29:15.400
Kenzo: So even if it may not be, uh, as useful as you'd like now, it feels right to give this back to you.

00:29:17.260 --> 00:29:18.359
DM: I, I appreciate that.

00:29:19.620 --> 00:29:24.830
Kenzo: And, uh, Kenzo, like, kinda Ergy, ergy, ergy, like, unscrews the- [laughs]

00:29:24.830 --> 00:29:24.990
Delwath: [laughs]

00:29:24.990 --> 00:29:25.330
DM: [laughs]

00:29:25.330 --> 00:29:34.580
Kenzo: ... the, the, the jade hand from, uh, the top of his, uh, staff and then, you know, goes over and, and, uh, you know, respectfully, uh, and humbly

00:29:36.420 --> 00:29:39.680
Kenzo: puts the, puts the hand back onto, uh, Rai's stump.

00:29:41.300 --> 00:29:42.720
