00:29:51.100 --> 00:29:51.280
DM: you know,

00:29:52.840 --> 00:29:55.080
DM: kind of a relaxed sigh in your mind.

00:29:59.280 --> 00:30:05.140
DM: You notice that when you put the hand on, that, like, most of the rest of the statue is actually quite worn.

00:30:05.140 --> 00:30:05.660
DM: Like, it's,

00:30:07.160 --> 00:30:12.360
DM: you know, it's like a sort of ancient statue that's, like, been eroded in places and it's, like, all the,

00:30:13.540 --> 00:30:21.892
