00:30:21.892 --> 00:30:28.212
DM: And it's not that noticeable but in contrast to the, like, new hand it's very clear.

00:30:28.212 --> 00:30:30.792
DM: And you do get a sense, like a, a sense through your mind like,

00:30:32.272 --> 00:30:34.362
DM: you know, this is a nice...

00:30:34.362 --> 00:30:35.722
DM: This is nice. Like it's,

00:30:37.932 --> 00:30:41.352
DM: you know, the effort of sustaining this for

00:30:42.872 --> 00:30:46.312
DM: 30 years even if it hasn't been 30 years here is non-trivial.

00:30:46.312 --> 00:30:46.792
DM: And so

00:30:48.612 --> 00:30:49.612
DM: there is a, like a,

00:30:50.952 --> 00:30:54.192
DM: you know, some relief as you attach the hand.

00:30:54.192 --> 00:30:55.092
DM: Like, this helps.

00:30:59.352 --> 00:30:59.632
Unknown: Okay.

